// Bake recipe of the `fx_ground` set (plan docs/plans/2026-11-09-effect-visualization.md §6.3,
// WP6a): `asset_baker effect-bake --recipe <this file> --sources-dir <dir holding the sources>
// --ledger docs/evidence/veo/ledger.jsonl --output-dir assets/effects`.
//
// Sources are named by their bare file names; each is cited by its ledger line in
// assets/effects/fx_ground.provenance.ron. Review: docs/evidence/effects/review/texture_review.md.
// - spine_erupt: Veo clip (effect-veo, third attempt). Only the eruption is kept (the spikes
//   slide up out of a floor slit); the clip's spikes never retract, so the first 1.6 s are
//   used and the effect retracts them by playing the flipbook backwards or eroding it. The
//   spikes are wider than the centre square, so the whole 16:9 frame is letterboxed.
// - ground_crack: two generated stills, top-down, a crack tapering to hairlines at both ends,
//   so segments chain along a line with overlap; variants, one layer each.
(
    set: "fx_ground",
    cell_size: 256,
    elements: [
        (
            name: "spine_erupt",
            look: Lit,
            source: Clip(
                file: "3ce386ff-1321-4c54-9728-fe8318208312.mp4",
                frames: 24,
                decode_fps: 24,
                until_ms: Some(1600),
                framing: Letterbox(feather_permille: 0),
            ),
        ),
        (
            name: "ground_crack",
            look: Lit,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_ground.ground_crack.20261110T004422Z-2247765-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.ground_crack.20261110T004525Z-2253706-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
    ],
)
